{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49332","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:53.995434+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194224583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penumallas1261","id":194224583,"login":"penumallas1261","node_id":"U_kgDOC5Ohxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194224583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penumallas1261","id":194224583,"login":"penumallas1261","node_id":"U_kgDOC5Ohxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"tf.raw_ops.SelfAdjointEigV2 produces a complex64 tensor for a complex64 input when executed eagerly. The same operation also reports complex64 during XLA tracing, but XLA subsequently treats the tensor as float32 when lowering tf.signal.fft, causing compilation to fail. Here is the [gist](https://colab.research.google.com/gist/jasminetrail/f1a3c37da37aa28f2a3ed9b439a0974f/issue.ipynb)\n\nThe following example reproduces the issue:\n\n```python\nimport traceback\nimport tensorflow as tf\n\nprint(\"tensorflow version\", tf.__version__)\n\ntf.random.set_seed(277)\nt16297 = tf.complex(tf.random.normal([1, 4, 32, 32, 32], dtype=tf.float32), tf.random.normal([1, 4, 32, 32, 32], dtype=tf.float32))\n\ndef model_277(t16297):\n    t16300 = tf.raw_ops.SelfAdjointEigV2(input=t16297, compute_v=False)[0]\n    t38427 = tf.signal.fft(t16300)\n    return t38427\n\n_args = (t16297,)\n\nprint(\"=== EAGER ===\")\ntry:\n    eager_out = model_277(*_args)\n    print(\"Eager Output Succeeded\")\nexcept Exception:\n    print(traceback.format_exc())\n\nprint(\"\\n=== XLA ===\")\ntry:\n    xla_out = tf.function(model_277, jit_compile=True)(*_args)\n    print(\"Compiler Output Succeeded\")\nexcept Exception:\n    print(traceback.format_exc())\n```\n # Error logs\n```\ntensorflow version 2.22.0-dev20260921\n=== EAGER ===\nEager Output Succeeded\n\n=== XLA ===\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/ipykernel_3686/4028911060.py\", line 25, in <cell line: 0>\n    xla_out = tf.function(model_277, jit_compile=True)(*_args)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages/tensorflow/python/util/traceback_utils.py\", line 167, in error_handler\n    raise e.with_traceback(filtered_tb) from None\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages/tensorflow/python/eager/execute.py\", line 59, in quick_execute\n    except TypeError as e:\n    ...<5 lines>...\n      raise e\ntensorflow.python.framework.errors_impl.InvalidArgumentError: FFT requires complex input type, found F32.\n\t\n\nPython Code Location:\n  File: /usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages/tensorflow/python/framework/ops.py:1275\n\t [[{{node FFT}}]]\n\ttf2xla conversion failed while converting __inference_model_277_542[_XlaMustCompile=true,config_proto=13561319589895757934,executor_type=11160318154034397263]. Run with TF_DUMP_GRAPH_PREFIX=/path/to/dump/dir and --vmodule=xla_compiler=2 to obtain a dump of the compiled functions. [Op:__inference_model_277_542]\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49332/comments","created_at":"2026-09-23T15:38:23Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49332/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/49332","id":5555759711,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":4409976544,"name":"bug","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABBtrm4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"7884fa","default":false,"description":"Runtime Error","id":8794528027,"name":"err: Runtime","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAACDDHZGw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/err:%20Runtime"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49332/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABSyYqXw","number":49332,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49332/reac